@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram


[*] --> Login

state Login
Login : entry / display journey details
Login : do / view journey details
Login : exit / user decides to activate driving mode or choose other options

state "Activate Driving Mode" as ActivateDrivingMode
ActivateDrivingMode : entry / activate driving mode
ActivateDrivingMode : do / activate
ActivateDrivingMode : exit / transition complete

state "Choose Other Options" as ChooseOtherOptions
ChooseOtherOptions : entry / choose other options
ChooseOtherOptions : do / select option
ChooseOtherOptions : exit / transition complete

state EatPlace as EatPlace
EatPlace : entry / select place to eat
EatPlace : do / view menu and order if hungry
EatPlace : exit / transition complete

state AccidentNotification as AccidentNotification
AccidentNotification : entry / notify authorities in case of accident
AccidentNotification : do / send notification during driving or in case of an accident
AccidentNotification : exit / transition complete

state Feedback as Feedback
Feedback : entry / provide feedback upon journey completion
Feedback : do / give feedback
Feedback : exit / transition complete

state LoginDecision <<choice>>
Login --> LoginDecision

LoginDecision --> ActivateDrivingMode
LoginDecision --> EatPlace
LoginDecision --> AccidentNotification
LoginDecision --> Feedback

@enduml
